<quick_start>

1. **Install Cubby**: `curl -fsSL https://cubby.sh/install.sh | sh`
2. **Get credentials**: The install script provides CLIENT_ID and CLIENT_SECRET
3. **Install SDK**: `npm i @cubby/js`
4. **Set environment variables**: CUBBY_API_BASE_URL, CUBBY_CLIENT_ID, CUBBY_CLIENT_SECRET
5. **Start building**: Use the examples above to integrate Cubby into your application

</quick_start>